{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">火把節是彝族傳統節日。在四川涼山會理，八方遊客相聚千年古城，圍著火堆踏歌起舞，共同參與這項節慶活動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SC.FIRE.MTV.0807-0817_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20269d20oLgoGR1786931178.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SC.FIRE.MTV.0807-0817_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T02:20:26.104003+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":50,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}